(text "Decoupling is shown as a separate functional block.\nPlace each 100 nF at its physical VDD or VBAT pin.\nVSSA and VSS return to shunt LOW / DC-.\nNo external VCAP on this package.\nVREF+ uses the external 3.3 V reference rail; VREFBUF OFF." (at 251.46 93.98 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c8b4ad92-071e-5c5e-b15b-82637675d768"))
(text "CROSS-SHEET SIGNALS\nPWM / ENABLE / BRAKE -> local command and gate pages\nADC inputs <- local RC filters\nABZ / SPI <- external sensor interface\nSWD / TTL / CAN / LEDs -> debug interface\nUse labels between blocks and direct wires within each block." (at 251.46 144.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2a20a2fb-b60c-585b-ab43-1fd232e693af"))
(text "Keep outputs disabled during reset and initialization. BKIN is active-low; disable automatic restart.\nPB15 TIM1_CH3N uses AF4. Three currents share two ADCs: sampling windows still require validation.\nSeven unused GPIOs remain explicit NC. Preserve NRST, SWD and the intended BOOT/UCPD configuration." (at 20.32 243.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "eef1a97b-53e2-5d9a-bc02-d91f7d11a040"))
